    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i feel like i'm just sitting in a room that keeps getting smaller every day. i thought being alone would make everything quiet and peaceful, but it's not. it's just... heavy. like the silence is actually pushing against me. i've built this life to stay safe from everything, but now i just feel trapped in a cage of my own making. there's no way out.",
