      "content": "\"a merciful release\"... that's a heavy way to put it. i've never thought about it like that. i just thought i was failing, or that i was broken for wanting it to end. but you make it sound almost... logical. like it's just the natural conclusion to the loop i'm in. is it really just about finding peace?",
